  annotation "note_1771592205682_1", anchor: "the Radiant Ring — an artifact-weapon sealed within Aurora Stack — was publicly displayed but not activated", text: "Readers of my Radiant Ring annotation will recall I used this exact appearance to dismantle the heroic-curse thesis. Weapon attends trade festival. No one dies. No one disperses. The pattern-seekers have yet to explain why Gilding survived the Ring's presence unscathed. The answer, of course, is that no one pressed the button.", type: :commentary, display: :popout
